","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"26:33","t":"And he drew out his hand; thereupon it was white for the observers.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"26:34","t":"[Pharaoh] said to the eminent ones around him, \"Indeed, this is a learned magician.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"26:35","t":"He wants to drive you out of your land by his magic, so what do you advise?\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"26:36","t":"They said, \"Postpone [the matter of] him and his brother and send among the cities gatherers","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"26:37","t":"Who will bring you every learned, skilled magician.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"26:38","t":"So the magicians were assembled for the appointment of a well-known day.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"26:39","t":"And it was said to the people, \"Will you congregate.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":39,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}